ng ground while balancing logs and  boulders on his shoulders he explains  that his training consists of only three  things training underneath the waterfall  carrying three logs on one's shoulders  and pushing a large boulder through a  nearby town inosuke who had passed out  underneath the waterfall and had been  resuscitated by tanjuro noted that he  could sense that gyome is the strongest  demon slayer entendro agreed with this  stating that the stone hashira was the  only one with a different scent from the  others gyome is later seen pushing a  giant boulder even bigger than the one  the trainees were supposed to use the  training was quite difficult but also  not compulsory which meant quite a few  of the trainees quit midway left aghast  at the effort required genya then  reveals to tanjuro that the chant  guilleme repeats often is in fact a  series of repetitive actions designed to  maximize his focus and allow him to pull  off feats such as pushing the boulders  later on when tantro successfully  completes the stone hashira training he  is left severely dehydrated yom may  pours water on him to save the boy he  then continues on and says that due to  completing his training and for his  actions in the swordsmith village of  prioritizing the villagers over his  sister he believes tonjiro is a true  swordsman however tonjero states that  the choice was made by nezuko and not  himself and thus he could not accept  gyome's approval upon seeing this the  stone hashira is left further impressed  at tanjro's honesty with all his doubts  now gone gyome states that he has fully  accepted tanjuro regardless of what the  other hashira may say  after receiving information that muzon  has appeared gyome hurried to the ubu  yashiki residence yomei is there to  provide backup to tamayo after she  successfully injects muzon with her  medicine and cleaves the demon's head  clean off yeome mournfully remembers the  first time he met kagaya when he was  only 18 years old and